sequenceDiagram

actor User

participant Gateway
participant Submission
participant Approval
participant AI
participant Payment
participant Platform

User->>Gateway: Submit Invoice

Gateway->>Submission: POST /invoice

Submission->>Submission: Validate

Submission-->>User: 202 Accepted\nTracking ID

Submission->>Approval: InvoiceSubmitted (Pub/Sub)

Approval->>AI: Evaluate Invoice

AI-->>Approval: Recommendation JSON

Approval->>Approval: Apply Policy Rules

alt Auto Approval

Approval->>Payment: Start Payment

Payment-->>Approval: Payment Success

Approval->>Platform: Notify Submitter

else Human Approval

Approval->>Platform: Notify Approver

Platform-->>Approval: Human Decision

Approval->>Payment: Start Payment

Payment-->>Approval: Payment Success

Approval->>Platform: Notify Submitter

end